Meteor buy the first second Irithel needs to keep moving.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Haas's Claws\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Purify Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Heavy CC Cleanse build for Irithel.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel#build-heavy-cc-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Haas's Claws\",\"text\":\"Purchase Haas's Claws (2,020 gold) as item 2 in the Heavy CC Cleanse build for Irithel.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel#build-heavy-cc-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Berserker's Fury\",\"text\":\"Purchase Berserker's Fury (2,390 gold) as item 3 in the Heavy CC Cleanse build for Irithel.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel#build-heavy-cc-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Windtalker\",\"text\":\"Purchase Windtalker (1,880 gold) as item 4 in the Heavy CC Cleanse build for Irithel.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel#build-heavy-cc-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Rose Gold Meteor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Rose Gold Meteor (1,820 gold) as item 5 in the Heavy CC Cleanse build for Irithel.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel#build-heavy-cc-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Gun\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Gun (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Heavy CC Cleanse build for Irithel.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel#build-heavy-cc-cleanse\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/irithel\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":43,\"name\":\"Irithel\",\"slug\":\"irithel\",\"title\":\"Jungle Heart\",\"role\":[\"Marksman\"],\"specialty\":[\"Finisher\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Gold\"],\"tier\":\"A\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2017,\"stats\":{\"durability\":10,\"offense\":80,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":30},\"winRate\":52.47,\"pickRate\":0.39,\"banRate\":0.26,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"miya\",\"heroName\":\"Miya\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Irithel counters heroes with a shorter Basic Attack range than her or ones that lack mobility and can be easily kited, such as Miya and Alpha.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"alpha\",\"heroName\":\"Alpha\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Irithel counters heroes with a shorter Basic Attack range than her or ones that lack mobility and can be easily kited, such as Miya and Alpha.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"badang\",\"heroName\":\"Badang\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Irithel is countered by heroes with strong CC capabilities or can restrict movement, such as Badang and Silvanna. Because Irithel does not have any Blink skills, her advantage vanishes once her mobility is restricted.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"silvanna\",\"heroName\":\"Silvanna\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Irithel is countered by heroes with strong CC capabilities or can restrict movement, such as Badang and Silvanna. Because Irithel does not have any Blink skills, her advantage vanishes once her mobility is restricted.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_f999fb58616e2d87c29dcb92177990f5.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a65d1e2ced64fbfdfcefdcfba719b3fd.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"6\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_23a7a603ff9d20074777d52e2eb202f3.jpg\",\"tip\":\"His ulti is best combo with Irithel's Ultimate.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"23\",\"heroName\":\"Gord\",\"heroSlug\":\"gord\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_24b9fa9519483b3d2168261b0fb6c0cf.png\",\"tip\":\"Irithel's passive can avoid from his skill and counter back.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"Freeze Irithel and can deal damage to Irithel.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Jungle Heart\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Irithel and Leo's immaculate teamwork allows her to shoot while moving. Each Basic Attack will shoot 2 crossbow bolt(s) (but takes longer to refill) that deal (+55% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage per bolt (inherits a portion of Attack Effects).\\nMoving will build up Jungle Heart, up to a maximum of 10 units, and cause the next Basic Attack to unleash 1 additional bolt(s).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Irithel and Leo's immaculate teamwork allows her to shoot while moving. Each Basic Attack will shoot 2 crossbow bolt(s) (but takes longer to refill) that deal \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+55% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" per bolt (inherits a portion of Attack Effects).\\nMoving will build up \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Jungle Heart\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", up to a maximum of 10 units, and cause the next Basic Attack to unleash 1 additional bolt(s).\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c5a562745b928518fe5a1021d74eb541.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Strafe\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Irithel launches a volley of arrows on the target area, dealing 330 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within and reducing their Physical Defense by 15 for 3s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Irithel launches a volley of arrows on the target area, dealing 330\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies within and reducing their \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Defense\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 15 for 3s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fa31f958db6f4955abb8c1601d09840d.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Debuff\"]},{\"name\":\"Force of The Queen\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Leo lets out a piercing roar, dealing 200 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and slowing them by 40% for 2s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Leo lets out a piercing roar, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to nearby enemies and slowing them by 40% for 2s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2e73066af2cc13979e1bed2bba0d3d8f.png\",\"tags\":[\"Slow\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Heavy Crossbow\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Irithel orders Leo to leap in the target direction and empowers her crossbow for 10s. For the duration, she gains 30 Movement Speed and her Basic Attacks shoot enhanced crossbow bolts, dealing 100 (+65% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and nearby units. Jungle Heart also accumulates faster for the duration.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Irithel orders Leo to leap in the target direction and empowers her crossbow for 10s. For the duration, she gains 30 Movement Speed and her Basic Attacks shoot enhanced crossbow bolts, dealing 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+65% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target and nearby units. \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Jungle Heart\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" also accumulates faster for the duration.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"30s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eba682528a82c53362daf41147f0034f.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Mobility\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Prioritize Skill 1 and lvl up ulti if available and lvl up skill 2 last.\\nRetribution - To be able to farm quickly and equip gears as soon as possible ,so that she can deal BIG damage.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Prioritize Skill 1 and lvl up ulti if available and lvl up skill 2 last.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Retribution - To be able to farm quickly and equip gears as soon as possible ,so that she can deal BIG damage.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"valir\",\"heroName\":\"Valir\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Irithel works best with heroes that can slow or provide hard CC such as Valir and Hylos because they allow her more opportunities to deal damage.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hylos\",\"heroName\":\"Hylos\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Irithel works best with heroes that can slow or provide hard CC such as Valir and Hylos because they allow her more opportunities to deal damage.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Irithel's Ultimate at the start to enhance her Basic Attacks, then use her 1st Skill to reduce the enemies' Defense and use her Basic Attacks to hit multiple enemies. Use her 2nd Skill to slow enemies and prevent them from getting close.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eba682528a82c53362daf41147f0034f.png\"},{\"skillId\":4310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fa31f958db6f4955abb8c1601d09840d.png\"},{\"skillId\":4300,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":4320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2e73066af2cc13979e1bed2bba0d3d8f.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Irithel should maintain distance from the enemy and use her 1st Skill to reduce their Defense. Kite the enemy with Basic Attacks to chip away their HP. If the enemy tries to close in, use her 2nd Skill to maintain distance and continue firing Basic Attacks. When the time is right, use her Ultimate to enhance her Basic Attacks and finish off the enemy.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4310,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fa31f958db6f4955abb8c1601d09840d.png\"},{\"skillId\":4300,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":4320,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2e73066af2cc13979e1bed2bba0d3d8f.png\"},{\"skillId\":4300,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":4330,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eba682528a82c53362daf41147f0034f.png\"},{\"skillId\":4300,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Irithel build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Demon Hunter Sword plus Corrosion Scythe power spike, positioning, and when not to pick her.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Irithel is a walking DPS turret with no brakes. She shoots while she moves, her ultimate cleaves grouped backlines, and her two-item spike ends games against tanks, but her base HP and physical defense run low while her attack growth runs high. Peel her properly and she wins the match; let an assassin touch her and she dies in under a second.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"irithel\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"gold-sprint-crit\",\"name\":\"Gold Lane Sprint Crit\",\"roleContext\":\"Gold\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"swift-boots\",\"name\":\"Swift Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"haass-claws\",\"name\":\"Haas's Claws\",\"cost\":2020,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\",\"cost\":2390,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\",\"cost\":1880,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\",\"cost\":3010,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"haass-claws\",\"name\":\"Haas's Claws\"},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\"},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"marksman\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"fatal\",\"name\":\"Fatal\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/fatal.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"quantum-charge\",\"name\":\"Quantum Charge\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/quantum-charge.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"sprint\",\"name\":\"Sprint\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the main threat is physical burst that reaches you during Heavy Crossbow.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic burst or mixed dive that kills you before Sprint creates distance.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a healer, shield support, or high-extra-HP front liner keeps the first target alive.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when enemies are stacking Physical Defense and range is less important than armor scaling.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default gold lane build that rushes crit uptime, then uses Sprint and Malefic Gun range to keep Irithel firing while moving.\",\"totalCost\":12130,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":300,\"sources\":[\"Haas's Claws\",\"Berserker's Fury\",\"Malefic Gun\",\"Blade of Despair\"]},{\"key\":\"critchance\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalChance\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":65,\"sources\":[\"Haas's Claws\",\"Berserker's Fury\",\"Windtalker\"]},{\"key\":\"critdmg\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalDamage\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Berserker's Fury\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":85,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Haas's Claws\",\"Windtalker\",\"Malefic Gun\"]},{\"key\":\"lifesteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.lifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Haas's Claws\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Windtalker\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Blade of Despair\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=irithel\u0026items=swift-boots%2Chaass-claws%2Cberserkers-fury%2Cwindtalker%2Cmalefic-gun%2Cblade-of-despair\u0026spell=sprint\u0026emblem=marksman\u0026talents=fatal%2Cweapon-master%2Cquantum-charge\u0026flex=wind-of-nature.blade-of-despair%2Crose-gold-meteor.blade-of-despair%2Csea-halberd.malefic-gun%2Cmalefic-roar.malefic-gun\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"anti-dive-flicker\",\"name\":\"Anti-Dive Flicker\",\"roleContext\":\"Gold\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\",\"cost\":720,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"haass-claws\",\"name\":\"Haas's Claws\",\"cost\":2020,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\",\"cost\":2390,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\",\"cost\":1880,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\",\"cost\":1910,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"malefic-gun\",\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"haass-claws\",\"name\":\"Haas's Claws\"},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\"},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"marksman\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"fatal\",\"name\":\"Fatal\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/fatal.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"quantum-charge\",\"name\":\"Quantum Charge\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/quantum-charge.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the lane threat or jungle threat is magic damage or chain crowd control.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the burst profile is mixed or magic-heavy instead of physical.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\"},\"trigger\":\"Use only when your roam and EXP laner can reliably keep divers away from you.\"}],\"notes\":\"Safety build for physical dive games where Flicker and Wind of Nature matter more than a greedier sixth damage slot.\",\"totalCost\":11040,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":170,\"sources\":[\"Haas's Claws\",\"Berserker's Fury\",\"Wind of Nature\",\"Malefic Gun\"]},{\"